<title>POLAND: ZYWIEC MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 1.41 MLN.</title>
<headline>ZYWIEC MARCH NET RISES TO PLN 1.41 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		   1997	1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.41 vs   0.40</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.31 vs   0.27</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.77 vs   1.11</p>
<p> Sales		   23.46 vs  14.34</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.58 vs   1.60</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.76 vs   2.56</p>
<p> Operating profit     9.23 vs   3.40</p>
<p> Sales		   68.31 vs  43.74</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish brewery is Zaklady Piwowarskie w</p>
<p>Zywcu SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
